Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.00,MainZH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}1989年冬 · 柏林{\i0}\N{\rSubSRC}BERLIN - WINTER 1989
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.10,MainZH,,0,0,0,,维克多，听好。\N{\rSubSRC}Viktor, listen to me carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:07.80,MainZH,,0,0,0,,万斯局长迟迟未启动\N{\rSubSRC}The reason why the Nightfall Protocol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:10.20,MainZH,,0,0,0,,“夜幕协议”，是因为密码本\N{\rSubSRC}was never activated by Director Vance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:12.40,MainZH,,0,0,0,,已在维也纳泄密。\N{\rSubSRC}is because the cipher key was compromised in Vienna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.60,MainZH,,0,0,0,,你骗我，艾琳娜！\N{\rSubSRC}You're lying to me, Elena!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:20.10,MainZH,,0,0,0,,史塔西若发现丢了胶片，咱俩活不过天亮！\N{\rSubSRC}If Stasi headquarters finds out we lost the microfiche, we're both dead before sunrise!
